sequenceDiagram
    participant DRV as XSpace Driver
    participant CMD as Command Parser
    participant LIFE as Lifecycle Manager
    participant SDKB as SDK Bridge
    participant SDK as claude_agent_sdk
    participant TRANS as Message Translator
    participant OUT as Output Writer

    Note over DRV: sidecar 之前崩了，driver 重拉新进程
    DRV->>OUT: 等到 claude_sidecar_ready
    DRV->>CMD: stdin: reconnect{workspaceId, threadId, runId, runtimeSessionId}
    CMD->>LIFE: dispatch reconnect
    LIFE->>SDKB: ClaudeSDKClient(options=resume=runtimeSessionId, include_partial_messages=True)
    SDKB->>SDK: client.connect()

    alt SDK 找到该 session
        SDK-->>SDKB: connected, session restored
        Note over SDKB: 不重发 claude_session_created (契约 §6.4-3)
        alt 上次 run 仍在进行
            SDK-->>TRANS: 续发 SDK message 流
            TRANS->>OUT: claude_assistant_delta / claude_tool_* / 等
            OUT-->>DRV: 续接事件
        else 上次 run 已结束但终态未送达
            SDK-->>TRANS: ResultMessage
            TRANS->>OUT: 补发 claude_run_finished/failed/interrupted
            OUT-->>DRV: 终态事件
        end
    else SDK 找不到 runtimeSessionId
        SDK-->>SDKB: error
        SDKB->>OUT: claude_transport_error(recoverable=false, threadId必填, runId已知时填)
        OUT-->>DRV: 失败事件
        Note over DRV: XSpace 标记 thread 失败，提示用户重新发起新 run
    end
